  (func $invSmall (param $coeff i32) (param $id i32) (param $out i32) (param $s i32) (param $b4 i32) (param $b8 i32) (param $afv i32)
    (local $part i32) (local $subTmp i32) (local $subOut i32) (local $k i32) (local $bx i32) (local $by i32)
